From: Addy Ke <addy.ke-TNX95d0MmH7DzftRWevZcw@public.gmane.org>

Pl330 integrated in rk3288 platform doesn't support
DMAFLUSHP function. So we add arm,pl330-broken-no-flushp quirk
for it.

